<title>FINLAND: AKTIA BANK NINE-MTH PROFIT RISES 81.6 PCT.</title>
<headline>AKTIA BANK NINE-MTH PROFIT RISES 81.6 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
